@startuml ProxyGenerierung
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF

skinparam sequence {
ArrowColor #8A0808
LifeLineBorderColor #8A0808

ParticipantBorderColor #8A0808
ParticipantBackgroundColor #585858
ParticipantFontColor #FFFFFF
}

skinparam note {
borderColor #000000
backgroundColor #E6E6E6
}

participant "**LEA**" as LEA order 1
participant "**Transport Node**\n**Function Block**" as Baustein order 2
participant "**Transport Node**\n**Proxy**" as Proxy order 3
participant "**Transport**\n**Management**" as TCS order 4

activate TCS
activate LEA


create Baustein
LEA -->> Baustein: Contains
activate Baustein

create Proxy
TCS -->> Proxy: Contains

LEA -->> TCS: Integration of the\nLEA MTP



note over TCS
Reading all transport-relevant
information from the MTP
end note

TCS ->> LEA: Configuration of the OpcUaTransportClientManager interface

LEA ->> TCS: Connection establishment to the OPC UA server

group FOR EACH Transport Node in the MTP


TCS ->> Proxy: Generation of a\nTN proxy\nwith unique ProxyId
activate Proxy


TCS <<-- Proxy: ProxyId = 'XXX'

TCS ->> Baustein: Configuration of the TransportNodeManager interface\n(ProxyId = 'XXX')

Baustein ->> Proxy: Connection establishment

end

@enduml
